---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Show project statistics

Usage: specforge stats [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]
          Path to the spec root directory
          
          [default: .]

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
